{"id":"vod_lz_57888","vodId":"57888","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"罪恶王冠","name_cn":"罪恶王冠","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20230416-1/ebf9b92e7d2a160a1576e74e0c6d1de4.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在2029年，被病毒袭击的日本陷入了混乱之后被名为“GHQ”的暴力组织全面接手，政府逐渐成为了傀儡。在这样动荡的大环境下，樱满集（梶裕贵 配音）只是一名平凡的高中生，过着属于他的平凡生活，直到那个叫做楪祈（茅野爱衣 配音）的少女出现在他的眼前。　　祈的真实身份为“葬仪社”的成员，这个社团以从GHQ的手上夺回日本自治权为目标不断进行着危险而残酷的战争。在组织首领恙神涯（中村悠一 配音）的引导之下，集成为了组织的一员，结识了同僚筱宫绫濑（花泽香菜 配音）和鸫（竹达彩奈 配音）等人。随着战斗的升级，各种迹象显示出集似乎拥有着神秘的力量，而躲在诸多敌人背后的究竟是怎样强大的存在，众人无从而知……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-16 15:50:28","playable":true,"episodeCount":22,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230415/17386_629b6562/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230415/17387_619bea3b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230415/17389_0deab5af/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230415/17388_ffbcd001/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230415/17393_a9087ce2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230415/17402_de8dfe49/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230415/17391_6263ccf5/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230415/17395_90a1f458/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230415/17394_d088f9e1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230415/17392_c3925f1d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230415/17399_46a20c09/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230415/17397_cde6754b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230415/17396_d74b58b1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230415/17400_c39d5d5c/index.m3u8"